<!DOCTYPE html>
<html
  class="brand-color-background scroll-smooth antialiased"
  lang="en"
  data-theme="light"
  style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"
>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About Coffee & Fun LLC | The Team Behind the Apps</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Meet the people behind Coffee & Fun, an independent studio making apps, browser extensions, free tools, and practical guides with care and curiosity."
    />
    <meta name="author" content="Coffee & Fun LLC" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <meta name="rating" content="safe for kids" />

    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/brand/favicon.png" />

    <meta
      name="title"
      content="About Coffee & Fun LLC | The Team Behind the Apps"
    />

    <!-- PWA Manifest -->
    <link rel="manifest" href="/assets/images/social/site.webmanifest" />

    <!-- Theme & Mobile Meta -->
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fef5ec" />
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default" />

    <!-- Icons -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/social/192.png" />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="/assets/images/social/192.png"
      sizes="192x192"
      type="image/png"
    />

    <!-- Canonical URL -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/about/" />

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Coffee & Fun" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="About Coffee & Fun LLC | The Team Behind the Apps" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Meet the people behind Coffee & Fun, an independent studio making apps, browser extensions, free tools, and practical guides with care and curiosity." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/about/" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/assets/images/social/pages/about.png" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Coffee &amp; Fun logo above a red About Us badge" />
    
    <!-- Twitter Card -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@bycoffeeandfun" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="About Coffee & Fun LLC | The Team Behind the Apps" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Meet the people behind Coffee & Fun, an independent studio making apps, browser extensions, free tools, and practical guides with care and curiosity." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/assets/images/social/pages/about.png" />
    <meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Coffee & Fun logo above a red About Us badge" />

    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "AboutPage",
        "name": "About Coffee & Fun LLC",
        "description": "Meet the people behind Coffee & Fun, an independent studio making apps, browser extensions, free tools, and practical guides with care and curiosity.",
        "url": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/about/",
        "mainEntity": {
          "@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#organization"
        },
        "publisher": {
          "@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#organization"
        },
        "isPartOf": {
          "@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#website"
        }
      }
    </script>

    {% include schema-org.liquid %}

    {% bundledCss %}
    {% pageCss "product" %}

    {% pageCss "about" %}


    {% include scripts.html %}
  </head>

  <body class="cf-about-page">
    {% include header.liquid %}
    <main tabindex="-1" id="main-content">
      <section class="ab-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="ab-wrap ab-intro">
          <div class="ab-hero-doodles" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="ab-cup-club">{% include about-doodles.liquid, drawing: 'cups' %}</span>
            <span class="ab-paper-plane">{% include journal-mark.liquid, drawing: 'plane' %}</span>
            <span class="ab-hero-note">three humans.<br>quite a lot of coffee.</span>
            <span class="ab-hero-spark">{% include about-doodles.liquid, drawing: 'spark' %}</span>
          </div>
          <h1 id="about-title">Small team.<br>Big curiosity.</h1>
          <p>We’re Coffee &amp; Fun. We make apps, browser extensions, and free tools for the little things that fill your day.</p>
          <div class="ab-actions"><a class="ab-button" href="#team">Meet the humans</a><a class="ab-button ab-button-outline" href="/apps/">See what we make</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include section-wave.liquid, waveFrom: '#fef5ec', waveTo: '#fffaf5' %}
      <section class="ab-story ab-wrap" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <div class="ab-story-grid">
          <article class="ab-story-card">
            <span class="ab-hand">independent since 2022</span>
            <h2 id="story-title">It starts with a<br>small “what if?”</h2>
            <p>A task that takes too many clicks. A page that’s hard to read. An idea that won’t leave us alone.</p>
            <p>We turn those moments into apps and tools, then share what we learn along the way.</p>
            <div class="ab-workbench" aria-hidden="true">{% include about-doodles.liquid, drawing: 'desk' %}<span>usually starts on a scrap of paper</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ab-principle ab-useful"><span class="ab-principle-art" aria-hidden="true">{% include journal-mark.liquid, drawing: 'bulb' %}</span><h3>Useful comes first.</h3><p>Save a step. Clear a distraction. Make something a little easier to use.</p><a class="ab-text-link" href="/apps/#tools">Try a free tool</a></article>
          <article class="ab-principle ab-access"><span class="ab-principle-art" aria-hidden="true">{% include about-doodles.liquid, drawing: 'window' %}</span><h3>Room for different minds.</h3><p>Readability, focus, and accessibility belong in the design from the start.</p><a class="ab-text-link" href="/accessibility/">Our accessibility approach</a></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include section-wave.liquid, waveFrom: '#fffaf5', waveTo: '#f7ece3' %}
      <section class="ab-team" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="ab-wrap">
          <div class="ab-section-heading"><div><h2 id="team-title">The people behind the tabs.</h2><p>A small team, from the first idea to the reply in your inbox.</p></div><span class="ab-crew-note" aria-hidden="true">the whole crew<svg viewBox="0 0 86 28" fill="none"><path d="M4 14C17 4 32 19 43 13C57 4 64 17 82 9M18 23C37 18 56 26 69 20"/></svg></span></div>
          <div class="ab-team-grid">
            {% for person in authors.people %}
            <a class="ab-person ab-person-{{ forloop.index }}" href="{{ person.url }}">
              <div class="ab-portrait"><img src="{{ person.photo }}" alt="Illustrated portrait of {{ person.name | escape }}" width="{% if forloop.first %}428{% else %}420{% endif %}" height="420" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
              <div class="ab-person-copy"><h3>{{ person.name }}</h3><p class="ab-role">{{ person.title }}</p><p class="ab-person-bio">{% case person.slug %}{% when 'robert-james-gabriel' %}Builds the apps and writes about what worked, what didn’t, and whatever broke that week.{% when 'courtney-hood' %}Gets the word out about what we make. Also responsible for the word “Snoopification.”{% when 'anna-brown' %}The person helping you find an answer when something doesn’t go to plan.{% endcase %}</p><span class="ab-profile-link">Meet {{ person.shortName }}</span></div>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include section-wave.liquid, waveFrom: '#f7ece3', waveTo: '#fffaf5' %}
      <section class="ab-explore ab-wrap" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
        <div class="ab-section-heading"><div><h2 id="explore-title">There’s more to the story.</h2><p>Things we’re making, figuring out, and occasionally drinking.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ab-explore-grid">
          <a class="ab-explore-card ab-notebook" href="/blog/"><span class="ab-explore-art" aria-hidden="true">{% include journal-mark.liquid, drawing: 'book' %}</span><h3>Our notebook.</h3><p>Build notes, practical guides, and the rabbit holes worth sharing.</p><span class="ab-card-link">Read the blog</span></a>
          <a class="ab-explore-card ab-shared" href="/open-source/"><span class="ab-explore-art" aria-hidden="true">{% include journal-mark.liquid, drawing: 'code' %}</span><h3>Code to share.</h3><p>Useful little pieces for someone else’s next bright idea.</p><span class="ab-card-link">Explore open source</span></a>
          <a class="ab-explore-card ab-coffee" href="/coffee-reviews/"><span class="ab-explore-art" aria-hidden="true">{% include journal-mark.liquid, drawing: 'cup' %}</span><h3>And yes, coffee.</h3><p>We review the coffee shops we work from. Research, obviously.</p><span class="ab-card-link">Read our coffee reviews</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include section-wave.liquid, waveFrom: '#fffaf5', waveTo: '#f9e7d8' %}
      <section class="ab-hello" aria-labelledby="hello-title"><div class="ab-wrap ab-hello-inner"><div class="ab-hello-doodle" aria-hidden="true">{% include about-doodles.liquid, drawing: 'hello' %}</div><span class="ab-hand">there’s a person on the other end</span><h2 id="hello-title">Pull up a chair.</h2><p>A question, an idea, or a thing you made with our tools.<br>We’d love to hear it.</p><div class="ab-actions"><a class="ab-button" href="/support/">Say hello</a><a class="ab-button ab-button-outline" href="https://discord.com/invite/J6EeMvSBYg">Join our Discord</a></div></div></section>
      {% include section-wave.liquid, waveFrom: '#f9e7d8', waveTo: '#fffaf5' %}
    </main>
    {% include footer.liquid %}
  </body>
</html>
